@page "/rtl-demo"

@*
    RTL demo (plan P6-T4), ported from the canonical SvelteKit reference
    (lily-design-system-svelte-sveltekit-examples/src/routes/rtl-demo/+page.svelte).
    Proves the internationalization design principle in
    AGENTS/internationalization.md -- "components do not assume LTR
    layout in their structural HTML" -- with a real dir="rtl" page using
    the classic places a design system bakes in "left" instead of
    "start": a breadcrumb, a data table, pagination, and a form with a
    radio group and a checkbox. The Arabic strings are copied verbatim
    from the Svelte reference (already reviewed) -- not re-translated.

    Re-verified for THIS app rather than assumed from the Svelte port's
    header comment:

    1. wwwroot/css/nhs.css (2000+ lines) is dead code here too: grepping
       every .razor/.cs/.csproj/.html file in this app for "nhs.css"
       finds nothing. The real styling comes entirely from the
       runtime-swapped managed <link data-lily-theme-picker> that
       App.razor creates pre-paint and ThemePicker owns once the
       circuit starts (see MainLayout.razor), pointing at
       wwwroot/themes/*.css -- confirmed byte-identical (via `diff`) to
       the shared root themes/*.css.
    2. The default theme,
       themes/united-kingdom-national-health-service-england-for-patients.css,
       already uses logical properties for every component this page
       touches: margin-inline-end on the breadcrumb separator
       (:where(.breadcrumb-list-item + .breadcrumb-list-item)::before),
       text-align: start on .data-table-th, and border-inline-start on
       .inset-text -- no fix needed. It does have a pre-existing
       physical .skip-link { left: 0 } (shared app-shell chrome, not
       this route's own content) -- left as an honest, unfixed note per
       the reference's own finding, out of this route's scope.

    This app's headless components (TextInput, CheckboxInput,
    RadioInput, Form, Field, Fieldset, Label, RadioGroup, ...) only
    declare Label/CssClass/AdditionalAttributes -- see
    BookAnAppointment.razor's header comment for the full finding. This
    page uses the same working idiom: lowercase `value`/`checked`
    attributes plus `@@onchange`/`@@oninput` via attribute splatting.
    RadioGroup renders a bare `<div role="radiogroup" aria-label="...">`,
    not a real `<fieldset>` -- already a working group via its own
    role + aria-label, so (per book-an-appointment.razor's documented
    finding) this page does NOT nest it inside a second Fieldset, which
    would double up the announced grouping region for no benefit; each
    RadioInput is instead wrapped in a real native <Label> for a bigger
    click target and a visible name that matches the accessible name,
    the same pattern BookAnAppointment.razor's reason step uses.

    A plain <form>'s default submit is a full browser navigation/reload;
    Blazor's @@onsubmit directive intercepts that natively (no
    :preventDefault modifier needed -- confirmed by the working forms in
    BookAnAppointment.razor), so this page's form uses a no-op handler
    to keep the interaction on this Interactive Server circuit, matching
    the Svelte reference's inert submit button.
*@

<div dir="rtl" lang="ar">
    <h1>عرض توضيحي للكتابة من اليمين إلى اليسار</h1>

    <BackLink Href="/">رجوع إلى الأمثلة</BackLink>

    <BreadcrumbNav Label="مسار التصفح">
        <BreadcrumbList>
            <BreadcrumbListItem><a href="/">الرئيسية</a></BreadcrumbListItem>
            <BreadcrumbListItem><a href="/components">الإعدادات</a></BreadcrumbListItem>
            <BreadcrumbListItem aria-current="page">الملف الشخصي</BreadcrumbListItem>
        </BreadcrumbList>
    </BreadcrumbNav>

    <InsetText>
        هذه صفحة تجريبية لاختبار الاتجاه من اليمين إلى اليسار. جميع
        المكوّنات هنا بلا تنسيق مسبق؛ التنسيق البصري كله من هذا التطبيق.
    </InsetText>

    <h2>جدول الموظفين</h2>
    <DataTable Label="قائمة الموظفين">
        <DataTableHead>
            <DataTableRow>
                <DataTableTH>الاسم</DataTableTH>
                <DataTableTH>القسم</DataTableTH>
                <DataTableTH>الحالة</DataTableTH>
            </DataTableRow>
        </DataTableHead>
        <DataTableBody>
            @foreach (var row in Rows)
            {
                <DataTableRow>
                    <DataTableTD>@row.Name</DataTableTD>
                    <DataTableTD>@row.Department</DataTableTD>
                    <DataTableTD>@row.Status</DataTableTD>
                </DataTableRow>
            }
        </DataTableBody>
    </DataTable>

    <PaginationNav Label="ترقيم صفحات النتائج">
        <PaginationList Label="قائمة الصفحات">
            @foreach (var pageNumber in PageNumbers)
            {
                <PaginationListItem>
                    @if (pageNumber == CurrentPage)
                    {
                        <span aria-current="page">@pageNumber</span>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <a href="@($"#page-{pageNumber}")">@pageNumber</a>
                    }
                </PaginationListItem>
            }
        </PaginationList>
    </PaginationNav>

    <h2>نموذج التواصل</h2>
    <Form Label="نموذج التواصل" @onsubmit="@(() => { })">
        <Field Label="الاسم الكامل">
            <Label For="rtl-full-name">الاسم الكامل</Label>
            <TextInput id="rtl-full-name" Label="الاسم الكامل"
                       value="@fullName" @onchange="@((ChangeEventArgs e) => fullName = e.Value?.ToString() ?? string.Empty)" />
        </Field>

        <RadioGroup Label="طريقة التواصل المفضلة">
            <Label>
                <RadioInput id="rtl-contact-email" Label="البريد الإلكتروني" name="rtl-contact-method" value="email"
                            checked="@(contactMethod == "email")" @onchange="@(() => SetContactMethod("email"))" />
                البريد الإلكتروني
            </Label>
            <Label>
                <RadioInput id="rtl-contact-phone" Label="الهاتف" name="rtl-contact-method" value="phone"
                            checked="@(contactMethod == "phone")" @onchange="@(() => SetContactMethod("phone"))" />
                الهاتف
            </Label>
        </RadioGroup>

        <p>
            <Label>
                <CheckboxInput id="rtl-agree-terms" Label="أوافق على الشروط" checked="@agreeTerms"
                               @onchange="@((ChangeEventArgs e) => agreeTerms = (bool)(e.Value ?? false))" />
                أوافق على الشروط
            </Label>
        </p>

        <p><Button type="submit">إرسال</Button></p>
    </Form>
</div>

@code {
    private const int CurrentPage = 2;
    private static readonly int[] PageNumbers = { 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 };

    private static readonly (string Name, string Department, string Status)[] Rows =
    {
        ("سارة أحمد", "الموارد البشرية", "نشط"),
        ("محمد علي", "تقنية المعلومات", "نشط"),
        ("ليلى حسن", "المالية", "متوقف"),
    };

    private string fullName = "";
    private string contactMethod = "email";
    private bool agreeTerms;

    private void SetContactMethod(string value) => contactMethod = value;
}
